Conflicts: notify-osd, dunst
Description: Rofication notification system
 Rofication provides an unobtrusive notification system.
 .
 New notifications join a list shown on demand. Optionally, setting
 rofication.popup.min_urgency also shows them as pop-up cards; pop-ups are
 off by default. A do-not-disturb mode keeps non-critical pop-ups away.
